            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [15], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "CRYING GIRL"},
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "What - what do you want?"},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [20], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [1, 0, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "She's... beautiful..."},
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [0, 2, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "CRYING GIRL"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Get away from me, or I'll scream!"
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Listen, it's nothing like that - "
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "I'm a friend... I just -"},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "CRYING GIRL"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Leave me alone! This is none of your business!"
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "What's wrong? Maybe I can help..."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "CRYING GIRL"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "No one can! No one understands anything!"
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "Maybe I -"},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "CRYING GIRL"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "What would you know about anything?"
            },
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Listen... all I know is that I was sleeping, and"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "heard you crying outside my door. I followed"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "you up here."},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "I'm not a very smart person, but I'm smart"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "enough to know what happens when"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "someone crying like you climbs up  a rocky"
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "spire in the dead of night during a rainstorm."
            },
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [5], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [5, 8, 0, 0, 2, 3], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [5], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "CRYING GIRL"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Oh? And what happens, Mr. \"I'm Not A"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "Smart Person?\""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "People get hurt. Usually, the would-be-rescuer"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "who is willing to jump off a cliff in the vain"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "hope of saving a pretty face."
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "<shrug>"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "And you don't know for a fact that I'm not"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "willing to do that, so why don't you save us"
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "both a lot of embarrassment and just come"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "back down to the village?"
            },
            {
              "code": 11330,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [5, 8, 0, 0, 2, 13, 23, 23, 23, 23, 15],
              "string": ""
            },
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "GIRL"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "That's a cute speech. Why do you think it's"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "going to work?"},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Well... you've stopped crying. That's a good"
